{"id":"vprave","lemma":"вправе","pos":"adj","rank":3697,"glosses":["one has a right"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7f/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Думаю, я вправе знать, что произошло.","en":"I think that I have the right to know what happened.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to take place","l":"произойти"}]},{"text":"Мы не вправе делать это.","en":"We don't have the right to do that.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"this / it is"}]},{"text":"Том вправе уйти.","en":"Tom is free to leave.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to leave"}]},{"text":"Я не вправе что-либо говорить.","en":"I'm not at liberty to say.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"either ... or"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"}]},{"text":"Ты вправе быть счастливым.","en":"You have a right to be happy.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to be"},null]}]}